# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible.
# Without this, `COPY churn_system/backend/` would pull in a ~400 MB .venv
# and `COPY churn_system/frontend/` would copy node_modules.

# --- version control / tooling ---
.git
.gitignore
.freebuff
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Python ---
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache

# --- Node / build output (the frontend is built inside the image) ---
**/node_modules
**/dist

# --- runtime data ---
**/history.db
